{"id":"en_wrongly-raised","title":"Wrongly Raised","titleEn":"Wrongly Raised","description":"Nina Chase spent years sacrificing everything to bring up two sons, trusting that they would care for her in her later years. On the day the family celebrated the boys' college admissions, her husband Harry Smith reappeared after being presumed dead, accompanied by his mistress Paige Young, and demanded custody of his biological children. Only then did Nina learn that the sons she had devoted eighteen years to raising were in fact the offspring of Harry and Paige. The shock triggered a fatal heart attack, killing her instantly. Granted another chance, she wakes on the day she gave birth, resolved to take revenge in this second life. Viewers can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/wrongly-raised/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/wrongly-raised/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Avenge","Urban","Family","Rebirth","CEO/Billionaire","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkv0u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_wrongly-raised_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkv0u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wrongly-raised_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkv0u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wrongly-raised_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkv0u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wrongly-raised_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label